// exit: 1
// stderr: expected 4 but got 5
/**
 * `assert(condition, message?)` and `assertEq(actual, expected, message?)` stop the program when they do not
 * hold; `aion test` treats a program that stops as a failed test.
 */
assert(1 + 1 == 2)
assertEq("a" + "b", "ab")
assertEq([1, 2].size(), 2)
assertEq(2.5, 2.5, "floats")
println("so far so good")
assertEq(2 + 3, 4, "arithmetic")
println("not reached")
